From b325dac4633e1eaf47ea9f969cef12ac890e1462 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alpamys Beissenbek <alpabisen@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:18:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] FS-11: harden public discovery and event details

- events.ts: stop inventing start dates, default unknown status to non-public,
  use backend `available` only for stock, filter list by visibility/suspension
- useEvent hook shared by details page and purchase button: id-bound results,
  stale-response protection, 404 vs retryable error
- details/list pages: error + retry, registration-window and sales-ended states
- i18n: new details.* keys in kk/ru/en
- add vitest (`npm test`) with data-layer regression tests
- docs/evidence/FS-11: evidence, gaps, stubbed-API browser check
